<section class="sanctuary">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<div class="section-heading">
			
			<h2>The Art of Relaxing</h2>
		</div>

		<p class="sanctuary__intro">
		Unless the service description specifies that your massage is received clothed, undress completely and wear the spa undergarments provided to you. You will be draped with a sheet throughout the service. Our therapists are trained to discretely drape a sheet over your body, only exposing the area being treated. For services that are received clothed, shorts and T-shirts are ideal. A robe, slipper and locker are provided for use during your spa visit.

		</p>

		<div class="quote-card">
			<div class="quote-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">&#10084;</div>
			<blockquote>
				"For your comfort To ensure you receive the utmost from your Ira Spa experience, we encourage you to communicate with your service provider regarding room
				 temperature, treatment pressure and technique…. And just ‘breathe’ Close your eyes and allow your mind and body to be quiet. Breathe deeply
				 and let tension slip away with each breath. Remember this time is for you."
			</blockquote>
			<!-- <span class="quote-card__footer">This time is sacred. This time is yours.</span> -->
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.sanctuary {
		padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.sanctuary__intro {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: var(--space-md) auto var(--space-xl);
		font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
	}

	.quote-card {
		    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 0vw, 2.5rem) clamp(0.5rem, 12vw, -1.5rem);
    transition: transform .4s var(--ease-soft), box-shadow .4s ease;
   
	}

	.quote-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-6px);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
	}

	.quote-card__icon {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
	}

	.quote-card blockquote {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);
		max-width: 640px;
	}

	.quote-card__footer {
		display: block;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		letter-spacing: 0.24em;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
</style>
